msgstr "`Общие положения и условия <https://weblate.org/terms/>`__"

msgid "`Privacy policy <https://weblate.org/privacy/>`__"
msgstr "`Политика конфиденциальности <https://weblate.org/privacy/>`__"

msgid ""
"The data processing agreement can be obtained in the `Customer area <https://"
